  "source": "// Serial calculator: type a whole number in the serial monitor; the board replies with its square and cube.\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  Serial.println(\"Send a number:\");\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  if (Serial.available()) {\n    long n = Serial.parseInt();\n    while (Serial.available()) Serial.read();\n    Serial.print(n);\n    Serial.print(\" squared = \");\n    Serial.print(n * n);\n    Serial.print(\", cubed = \");\n    Serial.println(n * n * n);\n  }\n}\n",
