  "source": "// Thermometer: an LM35 (10 mV/°C) on A1 is read with the 1.1 V reference; LED 13 warns above 30 °C.\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  analogReference(INTERNAL);\n  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int raw = analogRead(A1);\n  float celsius = raw * (1100.0 / 1024.0) / 10.0;\n  Serial.print(\"Temperature: \");\n  Serial.print(celsius, 1);\n  Serial.println(\" C\");\n  digitalWrite(13, celsius > 30.0 ? HIGH : LOW);\n  delay(1000);\n}\n",
